"テンテン","textMapHash":4115232850,"text":"やっほー！先輩方、海灯祭楽しんでる？","nextNodeIds":[715140102]},{"nodeId":715140102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2096,"speakerName":"テンテン","textMapHash":2975874466,"text":"最近は何か面白いことをやってるかな？私と一緒に特別な冒険をしてみる気はない？","nextNodeIds":[715140103]},{"nodeId":715140103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1738028042,"text":"おお！オイラたちを先輩って呼ぶなんて、嬉しいこと言ってくれるぜ！","nextNodeIds":[715140104]},{"nodeId":715140104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3171272186,"text":"最近どころか、オイラたちはいつも楽しいことをやってるぜ！そういえば…おまえ、なんだか見覚えがあるな。","nextNodeIds":[715140105]},{"nodeId":715140105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2096,"speakerName":"テンテン","textMapHash":951163714,"text":"あなたたちって、冒険者協会の「超皆勤王」でしょ。それなら、きっと私のことを見たことがあると思うよ！","nextNodeIds":[715140106]},{"nodeId":715140106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2096,"speakerName":"テンテン","textMapHash":908907634,"text":"私はテンテン、普段は緋雲の丘の近くで協会のために新人を勧誘してるの。","nextNodeIds":[715140107]},{"nodeId":715140107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2096,"speakerName":"テンテン","textMapHash":88829834,"text":"緋雲の丘に行ったことがある人は、全員私の声を聞いたことあるはずだね。もちろん、一緒にいる猫や犬も含めて！","nextNodeIds":[715140108,715140110]},{"nodeId":715140108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2434370842,"text":"少し覚えがあるような…","nextNodeIds":[715140109]},{"nodeId":715140109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2096,"speakerName":"テンテン","textMapHash":2757624418,"text":"うんうん、私の努力が先輩方に届いたってことだね！なら、私の傑作を先輩方に体験してもらわなきゃ！","nextNodeIds":[715140112]},{"nodeId":715140112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4048344338,"text":"そこまで言うなら、オイラたち先輩もその思いを無下にはできないな！","nextNodeIds":[715140113]},{"nodeId":715140113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3232026546,"text":"その特別な冒険ってやらを、簡単に説明してくれないか？","nextNodeIds":[715140114]},{"nodeId":715140114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2096,"speakerName":"テンテン","textMapHash":438833978,"text":"うん！じゃあ、本題に入るね！","nextNodeIds":[715140115]},{"nodeId":715140115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2096,"speakerName":"テンテン","textMapHash":2143450466,"text":"最近、万文集舎で新しい小説を…じゃなくて、新しい情報を見つけたの！","nextNodeIds":[715140116]},{"nodeId":715140116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2096,"speakerName":"テンテン","textMapHash":337330522,"text":"それで判明したんだけど、ここ最近、人々の冒険に対する意欲が高まってきてるんだ！登山とか風の翼で滑空するみたいなイベントは、以前ほど魅力的なものではなくなってきてるみたい。","nextNodeIds":[715140117]},{"nodeId":715140117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2096,"speakerName":"テンテン","textMapHash":3748470282,"text":"だから、より多くの人に冒険者協会に入ってもらうためにも、新しくて珍しい刺激的な体験が必要でね。","nextNodeIds":[715140118]},{"nodeId":715140118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2096,"speakerName":"テンテン","textMapHash":597030898,"text":"そこで私は、他の地域にいる何人かの宣伝員と手を取り合うことにしたの。一緒に大枚をはたいて、登山のプロと花火職人を雇い、まったく新しいタイムトライアルを設計したってわけ！","nextNodeIds":[715140119]},{"nodeId":715140119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2096,"speakerName":"テンテン","textMapHash":2973571810,"text":"この挑戦では、いろんな仕掛けを設置してるの。それを踏むと、花火と火薬の爆発による推進力で一気に空へ飛べて、物凄い加速ができるんだ！","nextNodeIds":[715140120]},{"nodeId":715140120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1292696770,"text":"花火？火薬？タイムトライアルで…空に飛ぶ…？","nextNodeIds":[715140121,715140122]},{"nodeId":715140121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2405852834,"text":"花火で吹っ飛ぶパイモン！","nextNodeIds":[715140123]},{"nodeId":715140123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":233367282,"text":"なんでそんなにワクワクしてるんだよ！？おまえも吹っ飛ばされるんだからな！","nextNodeIds":[715140124]},{"nodeId":715140124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2736169834,"text":"まあ、おまえの実力なら、目の前でタル爆弾が爆発しても大丈夫だろうけど…それでも、頭がクラクラするかもしれないぞ！","nextNodeIds":[715140125]},{"nodeId":715140125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2096,"speakerName":"テンテン","textMapHash":2686479138,"text":"大丈夫、安心して。爆発は丈夫な装置の内部だけで起こすから。何重もの安全措置を施してあって、絶対にケガすることないよ！","nextNodeIds":[715140126]},{"nodeId":715140126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2096,"speakerName":"テンテン","textMapHash":2419942498,"text":"それに、総務司にも正式な報告をしてあるの。宣伝の時も、真似しないよう念入りに注意してるしね！","nextNodeIds":[715140127]},{"nodeId":715140127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4190056442,"text":"そんなに細かなとこまで考えてあるのか？用意周到だな！","nextNodeIds":[715140128]},{"nodeId":715140128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2096,"speakerName":"テンテン","textMapHash":3925415130,"text":"私の予想では、このタイムトライアルを遊んだ人がたとえ一般人であっても、心にある冒険魂に火がつくこと間違いなしだよ！","nextNodeIds":[715140129]},{"nodeId":715140129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2096,"speakerName":"テンテン","textMapHash":545526762,"text":"先輩方はとても有名だから、もし先陣を切ってこのタイムトライアルに参加してくれれば、きっと多くの人を惹きつけることができるはず。","nextNodeIds":[715140130]},{"nodeId":715140130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2096,"speakerName":"テンテン","textMapHash":1378479002,"text":"それに、この挑戦には豊富な報酬を用意してあるの。これならきっと評判を聞いて駆けつけて来た人たちを、冒険者協会の新しいメンバーにできると思う！","nextNodeIds":[715140131,715140133]},{"nodeId":715140131,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3448997290,"text":"いいね、花火火薬タイムトライアル！","nextNodeIds":[715140132]},{"nodeId":715140132,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1834826266,"text":"おう！報酬がもらえるなら、やらない理由はないぜ！","nextNodeIds":[715140135]},{"nodeId":715140135,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2096,"speakerName":"テンテン","textMapHash":2659271426,"text":"じゃあ、決まりだね！さっそく挑戦してみて！","nextNodeIds":[715140136]},{"nodeId":715140136,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2096,"speakerName":"テンテン","textMapHash":2205749866,"text":"えへへ、今回のタイムトライアル、結構コースが多いんだ。きっと存分に楽しんでもらえるよ！それによって、私も数ヶ月分に匹敵する良い業績が手に入るし、お互いにお得だね！","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":715140133,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3279296634,"text":"パイモンと一緒に飛ばされる、こわい！","nextNodeIds":[715140134]},{"nodeId":715140134,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1338692522,"text":"おい！そう言いながら笑ってるじゃんかよ！…まあ、テンテンも安全措置は完璧だって言ってるし、おまえも試してみたいだろ？","nextNodeIds":[715140135]},{"nodeId":715140122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3824487322,"text":"火薬で突進するパイモン！","nextNodeIds":[715140123]},{"nodeId":715140110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1495586306,"text":"まったく覚えがない…","nextNodeIds":[715140111]},{"nodeId":715140111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2096,"speakerName":"テンテン","textMapHash":1871722146,"text":"本当に覚えてないの？だったら、なおさら私の傑作でもっと多くの人に私を覚えてもら…じゃなくて、多くの人に協会に入ってもらわないと！","nextNodeIds":[715140112]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7151401,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["2096"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7151401],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2096,"speakerName":"テンテン","count":20},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","count":10},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":6}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_ALL","BEGCMMJKCFC":[171514],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":356937630,"CHECNJEMEFE":{"2096":[1230]},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_GUIDE","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":false,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{},"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GBFMDJLKJBF":[],"GMENNHMBBOH":[],"HCJHEADFCAO":0,"IBEGAHMEABP":[{"<DLGBBMLABO